From 3e46b889f4f2b6e655cff1a2c89e20bdecdd747b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 02:43:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Circuit Lab: layouts, AI co-coding, wireless parts and
 boards, soldering workshop
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Design / Split / Code views, program panel bottom/left/right/floating, resize, full screen
- Code with AI: write, change (selection-aware), fix, continue, explain; per-change review;
  offline quick fixes; describe-to-blocks (and Sparky in kid mode)
- HC-05 Bluetooth + phone controller, HC-12 radio, 433 MHz key fob and receiver;
  SoftwareSerial with real Stream timeouts; one program per board, several boards at once
- Perfboard and stripboard: soldering iron (cold joints, heat damage, bridges), solder sucker,
  hot air, cutters, track cutter — all real connectivity in the simulator
- New examples, tests (engine suites + Django)
